      "number_raw": "123",
      "source_number": "123",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Each one of these marks is for a past attempt on Hightower's life.  I bagged each and every one of them.  Tell me...# do you know what this fool Decker hired looks like?",
      "source_text": "Each one of these marks is for a past attempt on Hightower's life.  I bagged each and every one of them.  Tell me...\n# do you know what this fool Decker hired looks like?",
